      "key": "invStakeout",
      "theme": "cream",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:38px 48px 42px;border-left:5px solid var(--accent);\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"FROM THE CHIEF INVESTIGATOR\" style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.5px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px;\" class=\"\">FROM THE CHIEF INVESTIGATOR</div>\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Stakeout Notes\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sectext);margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">WEEK 1 debrief</div>\n      <div class=\"li-list\" data-proto=\"&lt;div class=&quot;li-wrap&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div contenteditable=&quot;true&quot; data-ph=&quot;New paragraph&quot; style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--sectext);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;li-del&quot; onclick=&quot;delLi(this)&quot;&gt;×&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\" style=\"\"><div class=\"li-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Here’s what I want you watching for this week. Most people miss it because they’re looking at the scale instead of the evidence.\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--sectext);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">Seven days in and your file already holds more evidence than most people gather in a month. Don't chase a perfect week — a few gaps in the timeline don't break the case. What matters is that you kept showing up to log what you felt.</p></div><button class=\"li-del\" onclick=\"delLi(this)\">×</button></div><div class=\"li-wrap\" style=\"position:relative;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"New paragraph\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--sectext);\" class=\"